      "content": "hey, im looking at some long-term investment opportunities in a mid-sized metro area. i have some census data and recent demographic shift maps for the different districts. i want to get a sense of which neighborhoods are likely to stay stable in terms of property value and which ones might be more volatile or start declining over the next 10-15 years. can you help me analyze the correlation between demographic trends and neighborhood desirability/appreciation?",
